  "slug": "dill-pickle-ranch-dressing-recipe-11945945",
  "name": "Dill Pickle Ranch Dressing",
  "recipe_type": "salad",
  "brief_description": "This dill pickle ranch is a homemade classic ranch salad dressing with a bit of zip from dill pickles. Serve immediately, or refrigerate overnight, which helps flavor develop and thickens the dressing for a great dip for veggies or chicken nuggets.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Combine garlic, salt, dill, parsley, onion powder, dill pickle, pickle brine, mayonnaise, and sour cream in the jar of a blender and blend until smooth, about 1 minute. Serve immediately. Cover and refrigerate leftovers."
    }
  ],
